Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:09.04,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,600)\shad3\blur1\fs60\c&HF1F1F1&}Episode 21 \N {\fs100} Footsteps of Spring {春の足音の巻}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.76,0:00:29.39,Narrator,,0,0,0,,One winter's day, the Hermit Village \Nwas holding its 7th midwinter training,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.39,0:00:32.66,Narrator,,0,0,0,,performed for three weeks straight. {?????????? no clue what she means by 3 7 21}{第七 21日}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.66,0:00:38.38,Narrator,,0,0,0,,But about ten days after the training started, \Na sudden cold wave had struck,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.38,0:00:44.20,Narrator,,0,0,0,,freezing over everything: mountains, rivers, waterfalls, and even the hermits!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.87,0:00:51.68,Narrator,,0,0,0,,What's that, a hot-water sack? \N That's not how you perform a midwinter training!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.68,0:00:54.50,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Oh? That looks like he's catching fleas.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.05,0:01:04.72,Narrator,,0,0,0,,My! What a naughty crab. {???????? nc what she means by pink}{ピンク describes pornographic things, so it's just another way to say "ecchi"}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.08,0:01:14.29,Narrator,,0,0,0,,I wonder what she's been spooked by.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.29,0:01:15.75,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.65,0:01:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That midwinter training is dandy stuff.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.58,0:01:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're pretty warm here.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.11,0:01:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That mister looks sorry. How long will he be frozen? {??????}{what child says "pitiful"?}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.64,0:01:34.47,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Ah, that looks like a deep freeze,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.47,0:01:36.79,Overlap,,0,0,0,,he likely won’t thaw until spring. {??????}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:36.79,0:01:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Grandpa, when will spring come?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.36,0:01:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Well, that's easy.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.52,0:01:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No one knows that for sure, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.40,0:01:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But? Hey, but what?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.39,0:01:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll tell to you alone, \Nbut keep it a secret.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.04,0:01:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It all depends on that weather vane \Non top of the mountain.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.52,0:02:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew, it's cold!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.42,0:02:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,When spring comes, the grass will... {???????????????????? maybe he's singing something?}{same word as line 35}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.07,0:02:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cold...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.97,0:02:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That mister must be cold...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.42,0:02:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is, all right!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.52,0:02:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.56,0:02:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then. That's better.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.94,0:02:45.24,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Why, isn't it convenient?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.35,0:03:23.44,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The spring winds are beginning to melt the snow.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.48,0:03:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Bathed in the spring sunshine, \Nthe field grass also sprouted. {fertile shoot of field horsetail​}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.01,0:03:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, even the waterfall melted.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.61,0:04:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a bit unfair, certainly. {?????????????????????? not a word}{不公平だからな、ごもっとも}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.14,0:04:18.83,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Oh, my! Even his unkempt beard thawed!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.83,0:04:22.23,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Oh, and the flea-chasing man got right back to it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.13,0:04:29.20,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Oh! How rude.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.35,0:04:34.89,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.64,0:04:38.40,Narrator,,0,0,0,,My, your leg went numb from sitting on it?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.03,0:04:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsk! They're pads! {???????????? nc what;s that batto}{ちぇ、パッドだな}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.84,0:05:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was worth dying for!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.55,0:05:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.39,0:05:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.98,0:05:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I got rejected again!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.31,0:05:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.73,0:05:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.84,0:05:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't right...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.55,0:05:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's way too early for it to be spring already.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.13,0:05:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder whose work it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.51,0:05:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that impatient child... {????????????}{けしからんヤツじゃ}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.34,0:05:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I have this strange throb around here.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.01,0:06:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because you're still young.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.18,0:06:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's spring now—it's only natural.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.61,0:06:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? What could that be?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.95,0:06:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's weird. I wonder if something's wrong with my eyes.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.72,0:06:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no... {????????? no clue why she's blushing}{you need to be really advanced to get what's so erotic about that eruption in the soil}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.02,0:06:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... I'm still sleepy...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.00,0:06:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.58,0:06:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't get enough sleep this winter.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.24,0:06:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how do you like the taste of spring?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.81,0:07:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you really planning on hibernating? {?????????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.45,0:07:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the fresh soil does smell nice.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.58,0:07:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's finally here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.23,0:07:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,In spring, women are all so...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.55,0:07:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, and it's here before you know it. {???????}{辞せず到来?}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.45,0:07:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,When spring comes, \Nthe warm wind even melts hearts.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.17,0:07:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In the ground and in the sand, {when spring comes, }it all comes alive, \Nfor the times they are a-changin'!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.58,0:07:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.26,0:07:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.88,0:08:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's spring!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.18,0:08:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Become a woman!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.56,0:08:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A moment! Just a moment!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.67,0:08:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Here! We can't well \Nshow you naked on TV, can we?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.24,0:08:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't be disrupting society's order, yes indeed. {???????}{世の中の秩序乱すもっとじゃ}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.08,0:08:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be in trouble \Nif you flash any more of your parts.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.96,0:08:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in trouble any way you look at it... {???????}{やっぱり乱れるわい、これは}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.23,0:08:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.36,0:09:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare he cheat on me! {given how it's his wife}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.67,0:09:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Winter General, take over! {?????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.27,0:09:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He really needs to go back to training. {??????????}{もう[something]始業し直すといいだな; not really sure but she's saying something about starting again and I assume it's his training in that waterfall (or frozen like he was before)}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.56,0:10:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can be at peace.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.01,0:10:08.24,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Indeed, she'll have nothing to worry about \Nuntil spring truly comes.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.17,0:10:13.98,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Oh, he froze while peeking!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.35,0:10:17.18,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Short is the flowers' life.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.11,0:10:21.53,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Going back to sleep?\NThen hurry up! Quick!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.52,0:10:24.78,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.20,0:10:52.74,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the mischief of the Senior Disciple's wife,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.74,0:10:58.07,Narrator,,0,0,0,,the spring breeze went back \Nto the cold north wind again
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.68,0:11:02.57,Narrator,,0,0,0,,You can't go against nature, after all.
